WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:00.775
Try it.

2
00:00:00.775 --> 00:00:03.375
Compute the pilot's metrics and exit.

3
00:00:03.375 --> 00:00:07.148
The failing criteria are on
the slide: time in the ring,

4
00:00:07.148 --> 00:00:12.550
the open severity-two, coverage, the
report-only defects, and the TLS failures.

5
00:00:12.550 --> 00:00:13.937
Pilot: no-go.

6
00:00:13.937 --> 00:00:16.512
Then the same for ring 1, two weeks later:

7
00:00:16.512 --> 00:00:21.418
time in the ring passes at ten business
days, coverage is a hundred percent,

8
00:00:21.418 --> 00:00:24.715
report-only is clean, the
emergency exclusion was

9
00:00:24.715 --> 00:00:28.080
tested on the ring's start
date, and the ring says go.
